+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. Dilimleme (Slicing)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Gunluk benzetme:</strong> Dilimleme, bir ekmek somunundan dilim kesmek gibidir. "Buradan basla, burada dur ve her n. dilimi al" dersiniz. start:stop:step sozdizimi Python listeleriyle aynidir, ancak NumPy dilimleme cok daha guclur — birden fazla boyutta aynı anda çalışır.</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Genel sozdizimi <code>array[start:stop:step]</code>\'dir. Python gibi, <strong>start dahil, stop haric</strong>tir. start belirtilmezse 0, stop belirtilmezse dizi uzunlugu, step belirtilmezse 1 varsayilir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards"><div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Temel Dilim</div><div class="card-body">Indeks 1\'den 4\'e kadar (4 haric) elemanlar. a[1], a[2], a[3] dondurur.</div></div><div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Adimli Dilim</div><div class="card-body">Basindan sonuna her 2. eleman. a[::3] her 3. elemani verir.</div></div><div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Ters Cevirme</div><div class="card-body">Negatif adım diziyi tersine cevirir. a[::-1] dizinin tamamen tersi.</div></div><div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Tam Form</div><div class="card-body">1\'den basla, 5\'ten önce dur, 2 adimla ilerle. a[1] ve a[3] dondurur.</div></div></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare"><div class="compare-title">GORUNUM (VIEW) vs KOPYA (COPY) — Kritik Fark</div><div class="compare-left"><div class="compare-label">GORUNUM (Dilimleme)</div>Bir dilim orijinal dizinin <strong>gorunumunu</strong> dondurur. Dilimi değiştirmek orjinali de değiştirir!<br><br><code>b = a[1:4]</code><br><code>b[0] = 999</code><br>Simdi a[1] de 999\'dur.<br><br>Gorunumler aynı bellegi paylasir — veri kopyalanmaz. Hizli ama anlamazsaniz tehlikelidir.</div><div class="compare-right"><div class="compare-label">KOPYA (Acik)</div>Bagimsiz bir kopya oluşturmak için <code>.copy()</code> kullanin.<br><br><code>b = a[1:4].copy()</code><br><code>b[0] = 999</code><br>a[1] degismez.<br><br>Kopyalar yeni bellek ayirir. Daha guvenli ama daha fazla RAM kullanir. Bagimsizilik gerektiginde her zaman kopyalayin.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\narr = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">10</span>, <span class="num">20</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">40</span>, <span class="num">50</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">70</span>, <span class="num">80</span>])\n\n<span class="cm"># Temel dilimleme</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arr[<span class="num">2</span>:<span class="num">5</span>])     <span class="cm"># [30 40 50]</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arr[:<span class="num">3</span>])      <span class="cm"># [10 20 30]     — ilk 3</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arr[<span class="num">5</span>:])      <span class="cm"># [60 70 80]     — 5. indeksten itibaren</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arr[::<span class="num">2</span>])     <span class="cm"># [10 30 50 70]  — her 2. eleman</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(arr[::<span class="num">-1</span>])    <span class="cm"># [80 70 60 50 40 30 20 10] — ters</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># 2D dilimleme</span>\nmat = np.<span class="fn">arange</span>(<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">17</span>).<span class="fn">reshape</span>(<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">4</span>)\n<span class="cm"># [[ 1  2  3  4]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [ 5  6  7  8]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [ 9 10 11 12]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [13 14 15 16]]</span>\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mat[<span class="num">1</span>:<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">1</span>:<span class="num">3</span>])  <span class="cm"># [[ 6  7] [10 11]] — ortadaki 2x2</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mat[:<span class="num">2</span>, :])       <span class="cm"># ilk 2 satir, tum sutunlar</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mat[:, <span class="num">-1</span>])       <span class="cm"># [4 8 12 16] — son sutun</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mat[::<span class="num">2</span>, ::<span class="num">2</span>])   <span class="cm"># [[ 1  3] [ 9 11]] — satirda ve sutunda birer atlayarak</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># GORUNUM vs KOPYA — kritik!</span>\nslice_view = mat[<span class="num">0</span>:<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">0</span>:<span class="num">2</span>]\nslice_view[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">0</span>] = <span class="num">999</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mat[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">0</span>])  <span class="cm"># 999! Orijinal degisti</span>\n\nslice_copy = mat[<span class="num">2</span>:<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">2</span>:<span class="num">4</span>].<span class="fn">copy</span>()\nslice_copy[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">0</span>] = <span class="num">-1</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(mat[<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">2</span>])  <span class="cm"># 11 — orijinal degismedi</span></code></pre></div>'

